 *  - The op re-validates its own preconditions from the DB at run time; the
 *    web side's dry-run preview is advisory, never trusted.
 *  - Results land in `payload.result` (JSON) so the UI can poll the row.
 *  - Mutating ops are NEVER auto-retried: a terminal failure sets attempts
 *    past MAX_ATTEMPTS before throwing, so worker/index.ts's runJob marks the
